WEBVTT

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:31.376
Every bit of biology I have mentioned here
can change in different circumstances.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.216
For example, ecosystems change.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:38.656
Thousands of years ago,
the Sahara was a lush grassland.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.296
Cultures change.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:44.656
In the 17th century, the most terrifying
people in Europe were the Swedes,

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:46.416
rampaging all over the place.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.616
This is what the Swedish
military does now.

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:50.480
They haven't had a war in 200 years.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.736
Most importantly,

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:54.376
brains change.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.416
Neurons grow new processes.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:57.896
Circuits disconnect.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.576
Everything in the brain changes,

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:04.800
and out of this come extraordinary
examples of human change.